// 1-16: true view. Neon and white stones take turns over current; a secret tunnel through a wall. Down and right.
id l1-16
name 1-16 DOUBLE VISION
tagline now you see it. now you're standing on nothing.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main neon white
mechanics current:2 neon:4 white:4 secret:1
new neon
portion 5 neon and white stones take turns
portion 4 secret tunnel through the wall
portion 5.5 stones down the drop
hardness 4.8
map
