text NEON FLOORS GO WHEN YOU HOLD {recal}. WHITE FLOORS ONLY COME WHEN YOU DO.\nTHE STONES TAKE TURNS. SWITCH IN THE AIR:\nHOLD FOR WHITE, LET GO FOR NEON. || NEON FLOORS GO WHEN YOU HOLD {recal}. WHITE FLOORS ONLY COME WHEN YOU DO.\nTHE STONES TAKE TURNS. SWITCH IN THE AIR.\nWHITE DRAINS FAST: ONLY HOLD IT FOR THE WHITE ONES.
text A WALL. OR IS IT.\nHOLD {recal} AND WALK THROUGH.\nKEEP HOLDING UNTIL YOU'RE OUT THE OTHER SIDE.
